cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Sentinel-2 unsupervised land-cover mapping
message: If you use this repository, please cite it and the Copernicus Sentinel-2 source data.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-05-21"
abstract: >
  Reproducible workflow that downloads Sentinel-2 MSI Level-2A imagery from the
  Microsoft Planetary Computer, performs unsupervised k-means land-cover
  classification, and exports a publication-ready map. The default case study
  covers the Mandalay region, Myanmar, using the 21 May 2026 acquisition.
repository-code: https://github.com/mrtinkooo/experiment-hub
authors:
  - family-names: Oo
    given-names: Tin Ko
    alias: mrtinkooo
keywords:
  - Sentinel-2
  - land cover
  - k-means
  - Planetary Computer
  - remote sensing
  - Myanmar
references:
  - type: data
    title: Sentinel-2 Level-2A
    publisher:
      name: European Space Agency / Copernicus
    notes: Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2026).
  - type: generic
    title: Microsoft Planetary Computer STAC API
    url: https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/
